@owner: mason
@stability: stable
@since: 2026-10-15
@reviewed: 2026-10-15

Feature: Share Store Provisioning Script
  "Renders the idempotent admin script for the share store: the share tree (objects/, s/, private .mason/) and a Mason-managed vhost that serves links but 404s the private prefixes."

  Provides:
    - setup.ShareStoreParams @source("symbol:ShareStoreParams")
    - setup.ShareStoreScript @source("symbol:ShareStoreScript")

  Consumes:
    - config.Share
    - setup.SnippetPath
    - setup.writeSnippetInstall
    - setup.writeCaddyReloadBlock

  Invariants:
    - The share tree MUST be 2750 mason-owned with .mason/ at 700 so the manifest is never readable by Caddy
    - The vhost MUST 404 /objects/* and /.mason/* and MUST NOT carry the general dotfile rule (share paths may be dotfiles)
    - The snippet MUST be named by the share URL host and start with the managed marker
    - The script MUST NOT create users, groups, or keys

  OutOfScope:
    - Server bootstrap (setup.BootstrapScript)
    - Share link operations (internal/share, internal/links)

  Scenario (happy-path): Share store
    Given share https://files.example.com at /var/www/share
    When ShareStoreScript renders
    Then it creates the tree and mason.d/files.example.com.caddy with the private-prefix 404

  Scenario (negative): Missing URL
    Given a share without a URL
    When ShareStoreScript renders
    Then it returns an error and no script
